  "title": {
    "rendered": "Höstlovsvecka på Visby GK"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-heading\">29 oktober &#8211; 6 november</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal313-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10006 size-full\" srcset=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal313-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal313-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal313-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal313-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal313-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal313-1980x1321.jpg 1980w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal313.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>HÖSTLOVSGOLF FÖR JUNIORER</strong><br><br><strong>Fritt spel</strong> för <strong>ALLA juniorer </strong><br>på 9-hålsbanan den 29 okt – 6 nov<br><br><strong>HÖSTLOVSGOLF FÖR SENIORER</strong><br><br>Spela 9-hålsbanan 300 kr/9 hål inklusive Dagens lunch<br>Spela 18-hålsbanan för 600 kr/18 hål<br><br>Boka starttid på <a href=\"https://mingolf.golf.se/Login?ReturnUrl=%2F\">”Min Golf”</a></p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/250721369_10228500024869549_300623749236752556_n-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10008 size-full\" srcset=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/250721369_10228500024869549_300623749236752556_n-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/250721369_10228500024869549_300623749236752556_n-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/250721369_10228500024869549_300623749236752556_n-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/250721369_10228500024869549_300623749236752556_n-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/250721369_10228500024869549_300623749236752556_n-1200x900.jpg 1200w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/250721369_10228500024869549_300623749236752556_n-1980x1485.jpg 1980w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/250721369_10228500024869549_300623749236752556_n.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>MÖRKERGOLF FÖR ALLA</strong><br><br><strong>Tisdagen den 1 november</strong><br><br>Vi spelar hål 1, 2, 7, 8, 9 på 18-hålsbanan med självlysande bollar och flaggor.<br><br>16:30 Korv med bröd för juniorer<br>17:00 Spel för juniorer<br>18:00 Spel för seniorer<br><br>Gratis för juniorer och seniorer 150 kr inkl. självlysande boll och fika. Anmälan på <a href=\"https://mingolf.golf.se/Competition/3197953\">”Min Golf”</a> senast måndag 31 oktober kl.12:00</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal322-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10010 size-full\" srcset=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal322-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal322-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal322-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal322-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal322-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal322-1980x1321.jpg 1980w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Hal322.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>TIPS OCH TRICKS INFÖR VINTERN </strong><br><strong>– GRATIS CLINICS MED TRÄNARNA!<br></strong><br>Fria bollar på rangen under tiden. <br>Drop-In gäller.<br><br><strong>Måndag 31 oktober</strong><br>Sving<br>11:00-12:00 och 15:00-16:00<br><br><strong>Onsdag 2 november</strong><br>Puttning<br>11:00-12:00 och 15:00-16:00</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/481_VisbyGK_JacobSjoman_16BITS_V1-copy-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5309 size-full\" srcset=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/481_VisbyGK_JacobSjoman_16BITS_V1-copy-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/481_VisbyGK_JacobSjoman_16BITS_V1-copy-600x400.jpg 600w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/481_VisbyGK_JacobSjoman_16BITS_V1-copy-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/481_VisbyGK_JacobSjoman_16BITS_V1-copy-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/481_VisbyGK_JacobSjoman_16BITS_V1-copy-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/481_VisbyGK_JacobSjoman_16BITS_V1-copy-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/481_VisbyGK_JacobSjoman_16BITS_V1-copy-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/481_VisbyGK_JacobSjoman_16BITS_V1-copy-1980x1319.jpg 1980w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>HALLOWEENGOLFE</strong>N<br><br><strong>Lördag 5 november</strong><br><br>9 hål poängbogey (1-9 på 18-hålsbanan)<br>Flera klasser vid många anmälda<br><br>Du bokar din starttid själv på <a href=\"https://mingolf.golf.se/Login?ReturnUrl=%2F\">&#8221;Min Golf&#8221; </a><br>och anmäler dig till <a href=\"https://mingolf.golf.se/Competition/3197933\">tävlingen här</a><br><br>75 kr inklusive fika<br><br></p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Rangen-1024x768.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10017 size-full\" srcset=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Rangen-1024x768.png 1024w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Rangen-300x225.png 300w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Rangen-768x576.png 768w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Rangen-1536x1152.png 1536w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Rangen-2048x1536.png 2048w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Rangen-1200x900.png 1200w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Rangen-1980x1485.png 1980w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>NU KAN DU TRÄNA EFTER MÖRKRETS INTÅG<br></strong><br>Testa vår nya rangebelysning. Fria bollar på rangen under dessa tider.<br><br><strong>Måndag 31 oktober </strong><br>mellan 17:00-20:00<br><br><strong>Onsdag 2 november </strong><br>mellan 17:00-20:00</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/KMputt22-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10061 size-full\" srcset=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/KMputt22-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/KMputt22-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/KMputt22-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/KMputt22-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/KMputt22-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/KMputt22-1980x1321.jpg 1980w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/KMputt22.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>UTMANA VARANDRA PÅ PUTTBANAN<br></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Ta med alla du känner och kör en puttävling på puttbanan. <br>Alla är välkomna!<br><br>För er som inte har egna är det gratis att låna putters och bollar i receptionen.<br></p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/large-VisbyGC_JacobSjoman_20210615_3152-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10014 size-full\" srcset=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/large-VisbyGC_JacobSjoman_20210615_3152-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/large-VisbyGC_JacobSjoman_20210615_3152-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/large-VisbyGC_JacobSjoman_20210615_3152-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/large-VisbyGC_JacobSjoman_20210615_3152-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/large-VisbyGC_JacobSjoman_20210615_3152-1-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/large-VisbyGC_JacobSjoman_20210615_3152-1.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>REA I GOLFSHOPEN<br></strong><br><strong>50%</strong> på golfkläder<br><strong>60%</strong> Vid köp av två plagg eller fler <br><strong>50%</strong> på golfskor<br><strong>30-50%</strong> på golfbagar<br><strong>30%</strong> på utvalda regn &amp; vindkläder<br><strong>30-50%</strong> på utvalda kepsar<br><strong>30%</strong> på utgående klubbmodeller<br><strong>50%</strong> på demoklubbor</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Visby-GK-hal-klubbhuset-1-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10027 size-full\" srcset=\"https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Visby-GK-hal-klubbhuset-1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Visby-GK-hal-klubbhuset-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Visby-GK-hal-klubbhuset-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Visby-GK-hal-klubbhuset-1-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Visby-GK-hal-klubbhuset-1-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Visby-GK-hal-klubbhuset-1-1200x900.jpg 1200w, https://www.visbygk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Visby-GK-hal-klubbhuset-1-1980x1485.jpg 1980w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>KRONHOLMEN RESTAURANG &amp; BAR<br></strong><br><strong>Öppettider och Meny 29 okt &#8211; 6 nov<br></strong>Alla dagar 09:00-16:00<br>Köket stänger 15:00</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Måndag 31 okt<br></strong>Svamprisotto serveras med palsternacks-chips och parmesan<br><strong>Tisdag 1 nov<br></strong>Pasta med köttfärssås<br><strong>Onsdag 2 nov<br></strong>Croque Monsieur<br><strong>Torsdag 3 nov<br></strong>Köttbullar med gräddsås, potatismos och lingon<br><strong>Fredag 4 nov<br></strong>Fiskgryta med aioli</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right wp-block-paragraph\">Veckans vegetariska<br>Rostad pumpasoppa serveras med vitlöksbröd</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right wp-block-paragraph\">Dagens 125 kr inkl. bröd, sallad och kaffe<br>Juniorlunch 95 kr</p>\n</div></div>\n",
